# The mini duck: a companion half the size of your duck (16x16 against 32x32), so it is
# exactly half at every integer scale. Facing right; palettes in catalog.json recolor it (each
# mini has its own colors, never a copy of a duck skin). Light from the top-left.
name: mini-duck
size: 16x16
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  E #1e1620
  W #f4e9d1
  S #d9c49a
  H #fffaf0
  O #f2872b
  D #b8561a

